/* ===== 弦溯战线 · 图鉴筛选栏样式（筛选 + 排序） =====
   物品图鉴与配件图鉴共用这一份样式。
   筛选与排序都交给 [[Widget:CardSelectGallery]]：
     · 筛选按钮 .cardSelectOption —— 读卡片上的 data-paramN
     · 排序按钮 .cardSortOption   —— 读卡片上的 data-sort-<键>
   排序写的是行内 order，不需要锚点、不走 :target；
   脚本不执行时卡片保持模块输出的顺序（游戏内展示序）。
   这里只补按钮尺寸与选中态，容器样式沿用 模板:筛选面板（它自带的 #css 在本站不生效）。 */

/* ---- 面板容器 ---- */
.gallery-filter {
    background: rgb(var(--klbq-surface-rgb) / .9);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, .05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(160, 207, 255, .3);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
}
.gallery-filter__row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
}
.gallery-filter__label {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--klbq-text-muted);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 28px;
    text-align: right;
    padding-right: 8px;
    text-wrap: nowrap;
}
.gallery-filter__divider {
    border: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(160, 207, 255, .4), transparent);
    margin: 4px 0;
}
.gallery-filter .gallery-filter__options {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    flex: 1;
}
.gallery-filter__options li {
    margin: 0 !important;
    float: none !important;
    list-style: none !important;
}

/* ---- 筛选 / 排序按钮（同款外形，行为由 data-* 区分） ---- */
.gallery-filter__options .cardSelectOption,
.gallery-filter__options .cardSortOption {
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 4px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: .875rem;
    line-height: 20px;
    user-select: none;
    margin: 0;
    transition: all .2s ease;
}
.gallery-filter__options .cardSelectOption:hover,
.gallery-filter__options .cardSortOption:hover {
    background-color: #f0f7ff;
    color: var(--klbq-accent);
    border-color: var(--klbq-border-strong);
}
.gallery-filter__options .cardSelectOption.selected,
.gallery-filter__options .cardSortOption.selected {
    background-color: var(--klbq-accent-strong);
    color: var(--klbq-on-accent);
    border-color: var(--klbq-accent-strong);
}
/* 排序方向指示箭头 */
.gallery-filter__options .cardSortOption.selected::after {
    content: " ▼";
    font-size: .75em;
}
.gallery-filter__options .cardSortOption.selected[data-sort-dir="asc"]::after {
    content: " ▲";
}

/* ---- 窄屏 ---- */
@media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .gallery-filter { padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; }
    .gallery-filter__label { width: 100%; text-align: left; line-height: 20px; font-size: .875rem; }
}

/* ---- 暗色模式 ---- */
.client-js.wiki-dark-mode .gallery-filter {
    background: rgba(30, 41, 59, .8);
    border-color: rgba(14, 165, 233, .25);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, .4);
}
.client-js.wiki-dark-mode .gallery-filter__divider {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(14, 165, 233, .3), transparent);
}
.client-js.wiki-dark-mode .gallery-filter__label {
    color: var(--klbq-text-muted);
}
